## Tech stack

- Java 21 + Spring Boot (via `org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-parent`)
- Maven build, Jacoco + Surefire quality gates
- Jenkins CI (declarative pipeline)
- Helm chart for Kubernetes deployment
- Prometheus metrics on `{{contextPath}}/actuator/prometheus`

## Local build

```sh
mvn -q -DskipTests package      # build
mvn -q test                     # tests
mvn spring-boot:run             # run locally on port {{appPort}}
```

The app exposes:

- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/health/liveness`
- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/health/readiness`
- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/prometheus`

